messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_compress.c
Line: 211
Function: TIFFRegisterCODEC
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The function calls strlen(name) without checking if name is NULL. If a caller passes name == NULL, this results in a NULL pointer dereference and an immediate crash.

Source context:
```c
